# Force LF in the index AND the working tree, on every platform.
#
# Not cosmetic. The evaluator id is a hash over file contents — rubric.yaml,
# the judge prompt template, verdict.schema.json. A Windows checkout with CRLF
# and a Linux CI checkout with LF would hash to different evaluator ids for
# identical content, so `verify` would fail on line endings and report it as
# evaluator drift.
* text=auto eol=lf
